                        ],
                        "form": "bestiaux"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f5ac187b-d514-4525-b864-7b183f175ea4",
                        "entry_id": "ea04afbd-817f-353b-91c5-f5dc2253b47d",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "bestiale"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "6ce20d57-aed6-4e09-baee-76c5b5abcf7d",
                        "entry_id": "ea04afbd-817f-353b-91c5-f5dc2253b47d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "bestiales"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dfab375a-736a-3ca7-8ee6-024e9c534e80",
                        "entry_id": "ea04afbd-817f-353b-91c5-f5dc2253b47d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui tient de la bête, qui appartient à la bête."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4b158bf-8433-4b5a-975c-d2d37a960530",
                                "sense_id": "dfab375a-736a-3ca7-8ee6-024e9c534e80",
                                "text": "Les instincts bestiaux assurent la survie des espèces."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "31eba43f-d202-48c6-99f9-e78b353d0d80",
                                "sense_id": "dfab375a-736a-3ca7-8ee6-024e9c534e80",
                                "text": "L’épée lui était entrée dans le front et avait piqué la cervelle, coup défendu par les lois de la tauromachie, le matador devant passer le bras entre les cornes de l’animal et lui donner l’estocade entre la nuque et les épaules, ce qui augmente le danger de l’homme et donne quelque chance à son bestial adversaire."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "32f5e3d7-f107-3f64-91d2-289451d3466f",
                        "entry_id": "ea04afbd-817f-353b-91c5-f5dc2253b47d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui fait ressembler l'homme à un animal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "pejorative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e185b2f5-9091-4c0d-a469-fec00e13a785",
                                "sense_id": "32f5e3d7-f107-3f64-91d2-289451d3466f",
                                "text": "On ne doit pas attendre, chez un homme, jeune encore, cette sagesse qui substitue le bon sens à la sensation ; et, devant une proie, l’instinct bestial caché dans le cœur de l’homme, le pousse en avant."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd87ee7d-23b5-493e-a610-75c30cefea4f",
                                "sense_id": "32f5e3d7-f107-3f64-91d2-289451d3466f",
                                "text": "« Dans l'ensemble, le traitement de l'État ne peut être décrit que comme bestial », concluent-ils."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b1173bd-36be-4d79-8bbf-b4f4f931da5a",
                                "sense_id": "32f5e3d7-f107-3f64-91d2-289451d3466f",
                                "text": "Je connaissais la brutalité que pouvait porter un homme. Mais pour la première fois, elle me fit vraiment peur. Je ne pouvais pas croire que la fureur bestiale à laquelle je venais d’assister venait de Hans, l’homme que j’aimais."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b558f189-3612-32fc-b39d-c586ca0efa84",
                        "entry_id": "ea04afbd-817f-353b-91c5-f5dc2253b47d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Zoophile."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f12b4f4c-3ffa-404b-8930-1ef27899a28c",
                                "sense_id": "b558f189-3612-32fc-b39d-c586ca0efa84",
                                "text": "Amour bestial, euphémisme pour désigner la zoophilie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "81304bb3-de3d-479e-8970-0c8e79c40518",
                                "sense_id": "b558f189-3612-32fc-b39d-c586ca0efa84",
                                "text": "« Vous savez combien de points de différence il y a entre son Q.I. et mon Q.I. ? 91 points… Elle est plus proche d’un gibbon que de moi : coucher avec elle revient à commettre un acte bestial. »"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6cd7c931-b927-470b-b945-f76c30d437f3",
                        "source_entry_id": "ea04afbd-817f-353b-91c5-f5dc2253b47d",
                        "target_lang_word": "bestial",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9f84fd09-67f9-44d5-b6a3-725f452c4f5d",
                        "source_entry_id": "ea04afbd-817f-353b-91c5-f5dc2253b47d",
                        "target_lang_word": "bestial",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bestial",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aacd09aa-af4b-3b54-b3f8-792e72d80d7b",
                                        "entry_id": "4ab4e6f0-982c-3450-bd38-c51f4fb8ed2d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Beast-like"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "literally"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60047da5-8fc5-4833-8893-c0963ed4ab41",
                                                "sense_id": "aacd09aa-af4b-3b54-b3f8-792e72d80d7b",
                                                "text": "Reputation, reputation, reputation! O, I have lost my reputation! I have lost the immortal part of myself, and what remains is bestial."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aed05469-54c6-4060-93c2-58f6e56a901b",
                                                "sense_id": "aacd09aa-af4b-3b54-b3f8-792e72d80d7b",
                                                "text": "By thee adulterous lust was driven from men /\nAmong the bestial herds to range […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79d71f9e-867b-4c03-85b7-beb1ce4a6a12",
                                                "sense_id": "aacd09aa-af4b-3b54-b3f8-792e72d80d7b",
                                                "text": "This familiar that I called out of my own soul, and sent forth alone to do his good pleasure, was a being inherently malign and villainous; his every act and thought centered on self; drinking pleasure with bestial avidity from any degree of torture to another; relentless like a man of stone."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c2e3f9b-116a-4f38-8bda-e984f167855b",
                                                "sense_id": "aacd09aa-af4b-3b54-b3f8-792e72d80d7b",
                                                "text": "His was a bestial face, a face that bore the stamp of Nature's eternal injustice."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6a261f2-cafd-4c29-b28a-a10161d5345a",
                                                "sense_id": "aacd09aa-af4b-3b54-b3f8-792e72d80d7b",
                                                "text": "Ah, if the invincible forest god of that dead past were but with them now. No longer would there be aught to fear from prowling beasts, or from the bestial Russian."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9446e8fe-ddc2-40e8-ab47-cc8936127f5d",
                                                "sense_id": "aacd09aa-af4b-3b54-b3f8-792e72d80d7b",
                                                "text": "The Game of Thrones novels were best sellers without fleshed-out Dothraki; the languages in Star Wars, one of the most successful franchises ever, are mostly gibberish, even if Han Solo claims to understand Chewbacca’s bestial warbling."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "bestial",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d55ef501-7af6-3b5a-847f-363554946ec3",
                                        "entry_id": "0ef6dff7-d95b-337f-8ac3-41fc1899e692",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cattle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Scotland",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "plural",
                                            "plural-only"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3dde5d53-7a45-4c92-ac6d-51552223bfff",
                                                "sense_id": "d55ef501-7af6-3b5a-847f-363554946ec3",
                                                "text": "[…] much must depend upon the way in which bestial are bought or reared, and the state of the markets when they are sold."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
